#   base_fetched <UTC>      YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ, when that master was fetched
#   rustc <rustc -V>        the toolchain, exactly as `rustc -V` prints it on the workstation
#   ci_rounds <N>           the registered CI run's rounds (condition 2; see the registration)
